  "title": "Zevia Announces Fourth Quarter and Full Year 2025 Results; Appoints Lead Independent Director, Andrew Ruben, to Chair of the Board",
  "summary": "Zevia PBC (“Zevia” or the “Company”) (NYSE: ZVIA), the Company bringing naturally delicious, zero sugar, clean-label beverages, today reported results for the fourth quarter and fiscal year ended December 31, 2025. Fourth Quarter 2025 Highlights Net sales of $37.9 million, a decline of $1.6 million year over year, largely due to the lapping of expanded distribution at Walmart in the same period last year Gross profit margin was 47.7%, a decline of 1.5 percentage points year over year, primarily",
